{"v":4,"catch":"更黑暗的是刻在卡片上的秘密…","desc":"來自Pony Island和 The Hex等遊戲作品的創造者帶來了最新的給電子遊戲的心靈融解、自我毀滅的情書。\n\n《賭命牌卡》(Inscryption)是一款墨黑色卡片式奧德賽史詩，將roguelike牌組建構、密室逃脫風格的謎題和心理恐怖融合到血腥的冰沙中。更黑暗的是刻在卡片上的秘密…\n\n在《賭命牌卡》中你將可以…\n\n通過輪抽、手術和自殘獲得一副林地生物牌組\n\n解開隱藏在雷希小屋牆後的秘密\n\n踏上意想不到且令人深感不安的奧德賽史詩旅程","publisher":"Devolver Digital","release":"2022-12-01","genres":["冒險","策略"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"ClassⅡ","size":"Switch 2 4.4GB / Switch 4.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d61f05e169b07f1742d26fed4b8840f5342b9f238458c04285a90679ab72ea6d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dca3b7715d0195757d2a99a7dd18ecc60afef659d4fea60d837ba091fe5977d8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ab1f1f4d6b237688f502761fddd7e917daedc284eade9f85faba9833f8ae23eb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e22a9da9263a8d6ee288a151d33b4012deb0f044a04ba03be302a0656dd584f4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/630d7ceb1ae38a0d290cd4936fc1e234270804a2c78363f5273a5c85eb8546d1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fae375117bb0f71b207a47ea794f6b079eee904b17a8de72f3e7ef965253908a.jpg"],"titleId":"010027f017b12000","dlc":[],"vids":["bEwdmNrdEvs","t2xcuixnPoU"]}